{"naY‌": [{"id": "naY‌", "headword": "नञ्‌", "headword_slp1": "naY‌", "fold": "naY‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The negative word नञ् is compounded with a case-inflected word with which it is in construction, and the compound is तत्-पुरुष।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नञ्‌ २.२.६", "२.२.६", "२.२.६ नञ्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["naY‌ २.२.६", "२.२.६", "२.२.६ naY‌"]}], "naYastatpurusat‌": [{"id": "naYastatpuruzAt‌", "headword": "नञस्तत्पुरुषात्‌", "headword_slp1": "naYastatpuruzAt‌", "fold": "naYastatpurusat‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The समासान्त affix does not come after a तत्-पुरुष समास of words like राजन् etc. herein taught, when the negative particle न precedes them.\n\nTerms: समासान्त", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नञस्तत्पुरुषात्‌ ५.४.७१", "५.४.७१", "५.४.७१ नञस्तत्पुरुषात्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["naYastatpuruzAt‌ ५.४.७१", "५.४.७१", "५.४.७१ naYastatpuruzAt‌"]}], "naYduHsuByo halisakTyoranyatarasyam": [{"id": "naYduHsuByo halisakTyoranyatarasyAm", "headword": "नञ्दुःसुभ्यो हलिसक्थ्योरन्यतरस्याम्", "headword_slp1": "naYduHsuByo halisakTyoranyatarasyAm", "fold": "naYduHsuByo halisakTyoranyatarasyam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix अच् comes optionally after the words 1. हलि and 2. सक्थि final in a बहुव्रीहि समास when preceded by a negative particle or by the words 1. दुस् and 2. सु।\n\nTerms: अच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नञ्दुःसुभ्यो हलिसक्थ्योरन्यतरस्याम् ५.४.१२१", "५.४.१२१", "५.४.१२१ नञ्दुःसुभ्यो हलिसक्थ्योरन्यतरस्याम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["naYduHsuByo halisakTyoranyatarasyAm ५.४.१२१", "५.४.१२१", "५.४.१२१ naYduHsuByo halisakTyoranyatarasyAm"]}], "naYo jaramaramitramftaH": [{"id": "naYo jaramaramitramftAH", "headword": "नञो जरमरमित्रमृताः", "headword_slp1": "naYo jaramaramitramftAH", "fold": "naYo jaramaramitramftaH", "headword_langua